<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 26 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Feb 26 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED FEBRUARY 26</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............804,100 up.......900</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......701,300 up.......500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......532,100 down...5,700</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....814,325 up.....1,695</p>
<p> Financial companies.......630,442 up.....3,769</p>
<p> New York business loans....44,989 up.......185</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......44,725 up.......165</p>
</text>
